# Conformance harness runtime artifacts. *.pem above already covers the
# generated cert material; these add the op-demo runtime files.
conformance/op-demo.pid
conformance/op-demo.log
conformance/op-demo.bin
conformance/certs/openssl.cnf
conformance/certs/truststore.jks

# Stray op-demo binary if `go build ./cmd/op-demo` is run from the repo
# root. The supported flow goes through scripts/conformance.sh, which
# writes to conformance/op-demo.bin (already ignored above).
/op-demo

# Internal-only artefacts (kept locally, never committed). The OSS-facing
# documentation lives in README.md, CHANGELOG.md, SECURITY.md, NOTICE,
# and CONTRIBUTING.md. The entire docs/ tree is internal working
# material and not part of the published repository.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
docs/
